Applied to: This Repository (Xophz-COMPASS), YouMeOS & The Compass Suite

## Definitions

"Covenant" or "License" refers to this True Omni-Source License, Version 1.0.
"Software" refers to the source code, object code, and accompanying documentation governed by this Covenant.
"Steward" or "Licensor" refers to the entity issuing this License and holding the primary copyright.
"Individual" refers to a singular human being or a sole proprietorship.
"Organization" refers to any corporation, partnership, educational institution, non-profit, government agency, or legally incorporated entity.

## Preamble: The Vision

Software built under this Covenant is not merely a product; it is infrastructure meant to serve humanity. It is authored in the spirit of _Source_ - the underlying consciousness and intelligence from which all human creation flows - with the conviction that foundational technology should be transparent, sovereign, and accessible to every individual who wields it.

This Covenant exists because the most critical layers of our digital future must not be enclosed, extracted, or monopolized by any single entity. The Software governed by this License is created so that every Individual may use it, build upon it, and profit from their _use_ of it. The Software itself is not property to be acquired or monopolized - it is infrastructure to be stewarded. The Steward retains the exclusive right to license its commercial use (as defined in Section 3) to sustain the ecosystem and fund the vision.

This Covenant represents a legally binding agreement: the source is available for humanity to study, use, and accelerate, provided it remains strictly shielded against corporate and systemic enclosure.

